- It allows people to swap between those tokens.
- Example: Pool(ETH/USDC) lets people swap ETH ↔ USDC.

Who provides this liquidity?
👉 Users like you! You can deposit equal values of ETH and USDC.

You become a Liquidity Provider (LP).

In return:

- You get LP tokens (proof that you own part of the pool).
- You earn a small fee every time someone swaps.

🧠 Think of it as you renting out your money to earn trading fees.



6️⃣ Swapping Tokens

